    "body": "is marking a button as read only going to actually solve anything though?  \r\n\r\nmessaging as to why the button doesn't do what the user wants/expects would still need to be provided.  being read only wouldn't solve that.  Arguably what could be done _now_ is not assigning an event to the button / preventing default until whatever condition is met - and still provide the necessary messaging / alternate behavior to render that messaging.",
